  Full HTML per host: /var/lib/homelab-scan/oscap-<profile>.html

  Neither score is a target. STIG is a DoD baseline and most of the gap is
  requirements this estate will never adopt — FIPS mode, smart-card auth,
  classified audit rules. What matters is the trend: a score that drops means
  something changed on the host, and that is worth knowing even when the
  absolute number is not.
{% else %}
